    {
      "id": "seg-0005",
      "index": 4,
      "startMs": 25246,
      "endMs": 31996,
      "text": "对对对，我就是想去淘点好物。听说还能砍价，我要狠狠地捡漏。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0006",
      "index": 5,
      "startMs": 32446,
      "endMs": 36078,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你别太离谱，人家手作很贵的。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
